{
  "bodyHash": "EH7LJvpODO8=",
  "content": "<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"781078843056368612220679\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FszWTIQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"420\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Reliсs 是一款易于安装的拖拽式模组，为游戏添加了数十种具有复杂且考究机制的独特物品。每件遗物无论是单独使用，还是与其他遗物甚至其他模组组合使用，都能发挥出真正的潜力。在创造每件遗物时，我们考虑到了整合包不会仅由我们的模组构成，因此模组的平衡性会自动根据整合包的需求进行调整，这使得 Relics 既适合原版风格的整合包，也适合生命值和伤害数值高达数千的整合包。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5sPMQuK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"386\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">《我的世界》并非无穷无尽，所有游戏内容迟早会耗尽，玩家只能自娱自乐。我们考虑到了这一点，并努力让 Relics 的体验在长时间内尽可能有趣。得益于我们的升级系统和随机属性，每件遗物都不会与其他遗物雷同。玩家可以自由选择从遗物中获得的属性，从而生成近乎无限数量的遗物套装组合。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/339/2023-04-21_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"232\" /></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">通过本模组，你将获得：</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 28 件拥有独特且复杂机制的遗物，快来集齐它们吧！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 类似 MMO 的随机属性系统。寻找最好的遗物，或者亲手重造它们！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 对遗物的升级和自定义功能，打造属于你自己的无敌组合！</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">◈ 渐进式的主动能力系统，尽情展示你的微操技巧！</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"918249872476659861259619\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYHFXh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">SSKirillSS - 管理、开发</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: sskirillss</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Telegram: @SSKirillSS</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">julewernvvp - 美术</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: julewern</span></li>\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Sketchfab: <a href=\"https://sketchfab.com/julewernvvp\">链接</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Vebste - 测试</span></div>\n<ul class=\"listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1\">\n<li><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Discord: vebste.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<h2 data-usually-unique-id=\"084308688994070370956414\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2x3ogo6.png\" width=\"181\" height=\"116\" /></span></h2>\n</div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：是否会移植到 Fabric/Quilt？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：目前暂无移植计划。但如果 Relics 进入</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-quot\">\"完成阶段\"</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">，且我对其仍保持兴趣，也不是没有可能。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：是否会移植到其他 MC 版本？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：每次移植到新版本 MC 时都会伴随着 Relics 的重大更新，因为其中通常包含模组的一些根本性变化。一旦当前更新的所有内容公开发布，我就会开始移植到更新的游戏版本。至于旧版本——不，不会进行回溯移植。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：能否添加一本指南书之类的东西？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：我不喜欢指南书的概念。所以，不，没有这个计划。但你可以自行添加到你的整合包中，或者如果你愿意，也可以做一个公开的维基。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：新版本 MC 的 Relics 内容会移植到旧版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不会。新内容只会添加到 Relics 所停留的最新 MC 版本中。所有其他版本仅处于</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-ldquo\">“仅修复 Bug”</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">的状态。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以为 Relics 制作扩展吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：可以，但是……我现在不建议这样做。仅仅因为 Relics 的 API 尚不稳定，并且变化非常频繁。最好的办法是等到情况稳定下来。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以创建你的模组的公开分支/旧版本吗？</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">答：不，你不能。但如果你是为了私人用途</span> <span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv h-lparen\">（</span><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\">比如和朋友一起玩，不发布到 CF 或其他资源平台）——你可以这样做。</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以在整合包中使用你的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：可以，如果你想用的话。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以将你的模组转载到其他网站吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：不，你不行。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">问：我可以参考你的代码来制作我的模组吗？</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">答：尽管模组的许可证是 ARR，但你可以参考 Relics 的代码。不过，请不要直接进行 Ctrl+C → Ctrl+V。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\">还有问题吗？—— <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\"><strong>访问我们的 Discord！</strong></a></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div><span class=\" author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z95iyz86z4z86zmz79zz83zz83zz85zgz73zx1ez122zz86z5z84zqz66zz71z0z84zwtqyv\" style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>注意：</strong>模组描述仅适用于 1.19.2 MC 版本及更高版本！</span></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
